          "Timestamp": "2026-08-05T13:32:10.236339-07:00",
          "Text": "Great point — adopted as a first-class design element: 'Agent-assisted anchor migration'. The agent that edits is responsible for migrating the anchors it displaced via a new comments_reanchor MCP tool (batch id -\u003e new line/section), enforced as a required post-edit step in the skill; the load-time cascade becomes the safety net for out-of-loop edits. Precision kept at edit time, exactly as you framed it. Resolving since fully adopted.",
